<title>UK: RHEINHYP PRICES 500 MLN MARK MARCH 2001 INCREASE.</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP PRICES 500 MLN MARK MARCH 2001 INCREASE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase, announced earlier by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    22.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.535    PAY DATE    19.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    99.37     SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 15.NOV.96</p>
<p>--  London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
